# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are planning to use client-side Estimator for circuit execution, you can use the `find_unique_layers` method from Estimator to create annotated boxes (layers):\n"
msgstr "회로 실행에 클라이언트 측 Estimator를 사용할 계획이라면, Estimator의 `find_unique_layers` 메서드를 사용하여 주석이 달린 박스(레이어)를 생성할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
