# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are planning to use Executor for circuit execution, consider using the [generate_boxing_pass_manager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager) function from [Samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic/) to create annotated boxes:\n"
msgstr "회로 실행에 Executor를 사용할 계획이라면, [Samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic/)의 [generate_boxing_pass_manager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager) 함수를 사용하여 주석이 달린 박스를 생성하는 것을 고려하세요.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
