# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most [`NoiseLearnerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-noise-learner-options) fields map directly to [`NoiseLearnerV3Options`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-noise-learner-v3-options), except the following:\n"
msgstr "대부분의 [`NoiseLearnerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-noise-learner-options) 필드는 다음을 제외하고 [`NoiseLearnerV3Options`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-noise-learner-v3-options)에 직접 매핑됩니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_layers_to_learn`: With `NoiseLearnerV3`, the number of layers to learn is based on the number of layers passed in.\n"
msgstr "`max_layers_to_learn`: `NoiseLearnerV3`에서는 학습할 레이어 수가 전달된 레이어 수를 기반으로 합니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`twirling_strategy`: With `NoiseLearnerV3`, the twirling strategy is defined by how the instructions are boxed and annotated (such as when using `generate_boxing_pass_manager()`).\n"
msgstr "`twirling_strategy`: `NoiseLearnerV3`에서는 트월링 전략이 명령어가 박스화되고 주석이 달리는 방식(예를 들어 `generate_boxing_pass_manager()`를 사용할 때)에 의해 정의됩니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are planning to use client-side Estimator for circuit execution, you can\n"
"set the `twirling.strategy` Estimator option:\n"
msgstr ""
"회로 실행에 클라이언트 측 Estimator를 사용할 계획이라면,\n"
"Estimator의 `twirling.strategy` 옵션을 설정할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are planning to use Executor for circuit execution, you can pass the `twirling_strategy` option to the [generate_boxing_pass_manager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager) function.\n"
msgstr "회로 실행에 Executor를 사용할 계획이라면, [generate_boxing_pass_manager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager) 함수에 `twirling_strategy` 옵션을 전달할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that with `generate_boxing_pass_manager()`, the `twirling_strategy` values use underscores\n"
"(`\"active_accum\"`, `\"active_circuit\"`), whereas `NoiseLearnerOptions.twirling_strategy` values use hyphens (`\"active-accum\"`, `\"active-circuit\"`).\n"
msgstr ""
"`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`에서는 `twirling_strategy` 값이 밑줄을\n"
"사용하지만(`\"active_accum\"`, `\"active_circuit\"`), `NoiseLearnerOptions.twirling_strategy` 값은 하이픈을 사용한다는(`\"active-accum\"`, `\"active-circuit\"`) 점에 유의하세요.\n"

